{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A New Adventure in Classic Metroidvania Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beholgar II is a pixel-art Metroidvania platformer inspired by the spirit of the '90s. Explore a vast interconnected world \u2014 from shadowy dungeons and cursed forests to forgotten temples and the very edge of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Powers &amp; Magic: Unlock powerful abilities and spells to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious, Layered Levels: Every corner hides secrets, enemies, or valuable upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Weapons: Equip ancient weapons to stand against monstrous bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Dark Fantasy Tale: Journey through a world inspired by Middle Eastern myths and supernatural lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Feel: Classic controls and CRT-style filters for fans of old-school platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Beholgar, this isn\u2019t just another battle \u2014 it\u2019s a journey that will shape his destiny. If you dare, descend into the depths, claim the ancient blade, and stop the Djinn King\u2019s rise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802600?t=1757173392","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802600?t=1757173392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802600/b7e0c82c28900d0b33dc6f848863443db1e68688/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757173392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802600/b7e0c82c28900d0b33dc6f848863443db1e68688/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757173392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"